WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.683
My first system was NES,

00:00:02.683 --> 00:00:04.470
I think when I was like
five or six years old,

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.000
seven maybe, and, you know, I
just fell in love with that.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.950
Just playing Super Mario
and, and one through three,

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:15.190
three still being one
of probably my favorite

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.030
game of all time.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:19.620
Super Mario World is climbing
it because me and my wife,

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.790
we played that before we got married,

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.300
that was one of the prerequisites

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.950
of our marriage that we had to make sure

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.450
that we could get through
Super Mario World together.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.703
That's a great test.

00:00:29.672 --> 00:00:32.830
We have to beat Super Mario
World 2: Yoshi's Island

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:36.800
in order to have a child,
because that only makes sense.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.010
And that's, I'm very
happy to have a format

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.020
where I could tell that
joke and not explain it

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.725
and people will get it.

00:00:42.725 --> 00:00:43.920
Yes, exactly.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.170
It's a safe place here.

